c","term":"보다","zh":"见，碰头","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某种目的而见人。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e46b85b0fb252f895ba2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83150-1-8-2","ko":"학교 앞 커피숍에서 만나자.","zh":"我们在学校前面的咖啡店见吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"앞","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}},{"text":"커피숍에서","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆，咖啡厅","explanation":"커피숍：咖啡店，咖啡馆，咖啡厅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"커피숍","audio":"/audio/3acd7d899b420be04f28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83150","senseId":"1","lemma":"커피숍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피숍에서","audio":"/audio/6478c5a1c5ef3a3459b2.mp3"}},{"text":"만나자.","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나자","audio":"/audio/db87772a2bc5c2996a99.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"3acd7d899b420be0","term":"커피숍","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆，咖啡厅","audio":"/audio/3acd7d899b420be04